   - Apply exp or reciprocal to features such as Me_Mi_interaction or interaction_SpMax_SM6_L to model exponential decay or inverse patterns.

6. Binary and Categorical Feature Engineering:
   - Perform one-hot encoding (one_hot, label_encode) for binary_nX_flag to allow better interaction with numerical descriptors.
